message: "If you use arjaa, please cite it as below."
title: "arjaa: an offline cross-reference and citation check for a Persian Word thesis"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-24
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mrzroot/arjaa"
